        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Tiny Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Friends</strong> brings a touch of charm and fun to your desktop. Customize, play, and interact with your very own virtual companion while enjoying a variety of playful features.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Change Your Pet</strong> – Switch between different adorable pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎩 <strong>Customize with Accessories</strong> – Add hats, glasses and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍎 <strong>Feed Your Friend</strong> – Keep your companion happy by feeding them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Play Mini-Games</strong> – Win apples through fun mini-games and use them to feed your pet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📏 <strong>Adjust the Size</strong> – Make your companion small and subtle or big and lively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱️ <strong>Drag &amp; Throw</strong> – Move your pet anywhere on the screen or toss them around for fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📂 <strong>Taskbar Mode</strong> – Switch to a minimal, taskbar-style mode for a lighter experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎬 <strong>Cute Animations</strong> – Enjoy a variety of charming and playful animations.</p></li></ul>",
